{"id":"5e9e2c1c3d7432b0","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-explicit-definability.md","title":"Explicit Definability","display":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-explicit-definability","aliases":["93-df-explicit-definability"],"display":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability","depends_on":["[[93-df-definability]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-explicit-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-explicit-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9bb2f4d85fff40f1\" href=\"?note=9bb2f4d85fff40f1\" title=\"93-df-definability\">93-df-definability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)\">\\(m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar v_m\">\\(\\bar v_m\\)</span> is the canonical variable tuple.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is the mnemonic free-variable sort tag.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}explicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land T\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\n\\forall\\bar v_m\\,\\bigl(R(\\bar v_m)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}explicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land T\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\n\\forall\\bar v_m\\,\\bigl(R(\\bar v_m)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Requiring <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> to belong to the base-language formula set formally excludes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> and prevents the circular choice <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=R(\\bar v_m)\">\\(\\varphi=R(\\bar v_m)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-definability","status":"resolved","id":"9bb2f4d85fff40f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-definability]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar v_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}explicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}_{93}(R,\\varphi,T;\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{OneRelExt}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L,R)\\land\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[m=\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(R)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_m)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land T\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\n\\forall\\bar v_m\\,\\bigl(R(\\bar v_m)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=R(\\bar v_m)","display":false}],"bytes":1691,"backlinks":[{"id":"3628414839005ad6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9bb2f4d85fff40f1","cc9bc888c7dda430","30a8f872911e731f","8b587d680bb02f51"]}